    "Текст записи:<div class=\"eng-text\"><p>Text A. Dear students, our language school offers different activities to make your stay here pleasant and exciting. Unfortunately, the swimming pool cannot be used for two more weeks until the renovation works are completed. However, you may take horse riding lessons from 3 to 8 p.m. The horses are calm and well-trained. In fact, our horses are often used for the needs of the Children's Rehabilitation Center as a complement to their gymnastics and swimming activities. Text B. Hi Jeff, it's Thomas. What's the score? I've heard that our team has won the first half. Is that true? I'm so sorry I can't be with you at the moment. So unlucky that the football match and my swimming competition happen to be at the same time. I'm doing well, and my coach is happy with the result. But our competition is not over yet. As soon as it is, I'll rush to the stadium. Don't know how long it will take me. The traffic is heavy. There may be traffic jams. Text C. Can I have a cup of green tea and a vanilla cake, please? A cup of green tea and a vanilla cake. Right. Oh, sorry. There isn't any left, I'm afraid. We've got an apple pie and a chocolate cake. Chocolate cake, then. Do you serve it with ice cream? Yes, with ice cream and walnuts. Sounds delicious. Yes, I'll take it. Okay, green tea and a piece of chocolate cake. Wait a moment. What was the other option you said? Apple pie with honey syrup. Which I'm allergic to. Should I change the chocolate cake for an apple pie? No, no. Leave it as it is. Text D. Happy birthday, Mia. Jack, it's great you've come. You are the first guest. The others are coming. Which means you've got time to see my present right now. Guess what it is. You recently said you would like to get this thing. Oh, I've wanted so many things. Is it a headphone set? Or ski glasses? Or a smartwatch? Very close. It's one of those three things. You told me you are going for a ski holiday soon, didn't you? Open the box. Oh, the glasses! With high UV protection. Let me try them on. Ah, they will look great with your ski suit and helmet, but ridiculous with your</p></div>"
